# .env — Aztec Plataforma config for this project
#
# Copy this file to your project root as ".env" and fill in the values.
# Add .env to your .gitignore — never commit API keys.
#
# How to get each value:
#
#   PLATFORM_API_KEY
#     Go to Aztec Plataforma → Settings → API Keys → New Key
#     Copy the generated key and paste it here.
#
#   PLATFORM_BASE_URL
#     The Supabase Edge Functions endpoint for Aztec Plataforma.
#     You usually don't need to change this value.
#
#   PLATFORM_PROJECT_ID
#     Go to your project in Aztec Plataforma.
#     The UUID is in the URL: /projects/<UUID>
#     Leave blank to let the harness operate across all active projects.

